---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Seller Center | Case Study";
const description = "Seller Center — caso de estudio profundo: 3 perfiles de usuario, IA generativa, design system atómico y validación.";
const ogImage = "https://mezasalaman.github.io/BETA/Media/SELLER%20CENTER/portada%20seller.svg";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} ogImage={ogImage}>
<main class="pt-10">
        <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
        <header class="mx-auto w-[90%] max-w-grid pb-24 pt-16">
            <span class="mb-8 inline-block rounded-full border border-electric/20 bg-electric/10 px-7 py-2.5 text-[9px] font-bold tracking-wide text-electric">SENIOR CASE STUDY 2024</span>
            <h1 class="mb-10 text-[42px] font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-[60px] lg:text-[82px]">
                Seller Center <span class="px-2 font-light text-[#aab4c0]">|</span> <br />
                <span class="text-electric [text-shadow:0_0_40px_rgba(74,111,255,0.2)]">Ecosistema</span> de Gestión y Ventas
            </h1>
            <p class="mb-12 max-w-[780px] text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-[#64748b] md:text-[18px]">
                Un ecosistema integrado diseñado para cerrar la brecha entre compradores, administradores de talleres y
                administradores del sistema mediante una gestión avanzada de servicios y flujos de trabajo automatizados.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
                <div class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border border-[#e0e5ec] bg-[#f3f5f8] px-8 py-4 transition-all hover:border-electric/30 hover:bg-electric/10">
                    <img loading="lazy" src="https://mezasalaman.github.io/BETA/Media/SELLER%20CENTER/stichgemini.svg" alt="icon" class="h-4 w-auto opacity-60" />
                    <span class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#475569]">Stitch Gemini Strategy</span>
                </div>
                <div class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border border-[#e0e5ec] bg-[#f3f5f8] px-8 py-4 transition-all hover:border-electric/30 hover:bg-electric/10">
                    <img loading="lazy" src="https://mezasalaman.github.io/BETA/Media/SATELOCK/make.svg" alt="icon" class="h-4 w-auto opacity-60" />
                    <span class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#475569]">Figma Make Workflow</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>


        <!-- ================= ROL & IMPACTO ================= -->
        <section class="mx-auto w-[90%] max-w-grid py-12">
            <div class="mb-10">
                <span class="mb-4 block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-electric">ROL &amp; IMPACTO</span>
                <p class="max-w-[980px] text-[17px] font-light leading-[1.6] text-[#475569] sm:text-[20px]">Unifiqué tres perfiles —comprador, taller y administrador— en una sola plataforma, con publicación asistida por IA.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 rounded-[24px] border border-[#e9edf2] bg-card p-8 lg:grid-cols-4 sm:p-10">
                <div><span class="mb-2 block text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-electric">MI ROL</span><p class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#0f172a]">Product Designer</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[12px] text-dim">3 perfiles · IA · Design System</p></div>
                <div><span class="mb-2 block text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-electric">EQUIPO</span><p class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#0f172a]">Producto + Ingeniería</p></div>
                <div><span class="mb-2 block text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-electric">DURACIÓN</span><p class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#0f172a]">≈ 14 semanas</p></div>
                <div><span class="mb-2 block text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-electric">HERRAMIENTAS</span><p class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#0f172a]">Stitch · Figma Make · GA4 · Mixpanel</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
                <div class="rounded-[20px] border border-[#e9edf2] bg-card p-7"><div class="flex items-baseline"><span class="text-[34px] font-bold leading-none text-electric">+22%</span></div><p class="mt-3 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#0f172a]">Conversión de journeys</p><p class="mt-1 text-[12px] leading-snug text-dim">GA4 · cohortes vs. flujo anterior</p></div>
                <div class="rounded-[20px] border border-[#e9edf2] bg-card p-7"><div class="flex items-baseline"><span class="text-[34px] font-bold leading-none text-electric">+32%</span></div><p class="mt-3 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#0f172a]">Eficiencia de navegación</p><p class="mt-1 text-[12px] leading-snug text-dim">Card sorting + pruebas de usabilidad</p></div>
                <div class="rounded-[20px] border border-[#e9edf2] bg-card p-7"><div class="flex items-baseline"><span class="text-[34px] font-bold leading-none text-electric">−30%</span></div><p class="mt-3 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#0f172a]">Complejidad de uso</p><p class="mt-1 text-[12px] leading-snug text-dim">Evaluación heurística + tiempo de tarea</p></div>
                <div class="rounded-[20px] border border-[#e9edf2] bg-card p-7"><div class="flex items-baseline"><span class="text-[34px] font-bold leading-none text-electric">−40%</span></div><p class="mt-3 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#0f172a]">Handoff diseño→dev</p><p class="mt-1 text-[12px] leading-snug text-dim">Claude Design: de 4 semanas a pocos días</p></div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-5 text-[12px] text-dim">Métricas medidas contra la línea base previa a cada rediseño. Valores relativos salvo indicación contraria.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- ================= CORE CHALLENGE ================= -->
        <section class="mx-auto w-[90%] max-w-grid py-20">
            <div class="mb-14">
                <span class="mb-4 block text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-electric">STRATEGIC ANALYSIS</span>
                <h2 class="text-[32px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] sm:text-[48px]">The Core Challenge</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-stretch gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
                    <div class="h-full rounded-[20px] border border-[#e9edf2] bg-card p-9">
                        <div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-4">
                            <img loading="lazy" src="https://mezasalaman.github.io/BETA/Media/SELLER%20CENTER/problem%20core.svg" alt="icon" class="h-6 w-auto" />
                            <h3 class="text-[22px] font-bold">Problem</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-[#64748b]">Fricción crítica entre la oferta de talleres y las necesidades específicas del comprador. Los datos se perdían en procesos manuales y desestructurados.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="h-full rounded-[20px] border border-[#e9edf2] bg-card p-9">
                        <div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-4">
                            <img loading="lazy" src="https://mezasalaman.github.io/BETA/Media/SELLER%20CENTER/requeriment.svg" alt="icon" class="h-6 w-auto" />
                            <h3 class="text-[22px] font-bold">Requirement</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-[#64748b]">Interfaz unificada para 3 perfiles clave: Buyer (B2C), Workshop Admin (B2B) y System Admin (Control), garantizando interoperabilidad total.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col justify-center rounded-[24px] border border-electric/20 bg-card p-8 sm:p-12">
                    <h3 class="mb-12 text-[20px] font-bold">User Profile Distribution</h3>
                    <div class="mb-9">
                        <div class="mb-3 flex justify-between text-[14px] font-medium text-[#334155]"><span>Workshop Admin (B2B)</span><span class="font-bold text-electric">65%</span></div>
                        <div class="h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-[#f3f5f8]"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-electric shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(74,111,255,0.3)]" style="width:65%"></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-9">
                        <div class="mb-3 flex justify-between text-[14px] font-medium text-[#334155]"><span>Buyer (B2C)</span><span class="font-bold text-electric">25%</span></div>
                        <div class="h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-[#f3f5f8]"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-electric shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(74,111,255,0.3)]" style="width:25%"></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="mb-3 flex justify-between text-[14px] font-medium text-[#334155]"><span>System Admin</span><span class="font-bold text-electric">10%</span></div>
                        <div class="h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-[#f3f5f8]"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-electric shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(74,111,255,0.3)]" style="width:10%"></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ================= AI INNOVATION ================= -->
        <section class="mx-auto w-[90%] max-w-grid py-20 text-center">
            <div class="mb-14">
                <h2 class="mb-5 text-[32px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] sm:text-[42px]">Innovación Estratégica con IA</h2>
                <p class="mx-auto max-w-[650px] text-[16px] leading-[1.5] text-[#64748b]">Aceleramos el ciclo de diseño y desarrollo integrando herramientas generativas de última generación.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="flex flex-col rounded-[40px] border border-electric/15 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#eaf0fb] to-[#dfe9fb] p-12 text-left transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-electric/40">
                    <div class="mb-9 flex h-[54px] w-[54px] items-center justify-center rounded-[14px] bg-[#2c6bff] shadow-[0_10px_20px_rgba(44,107,255,0.3)]"><img loading="lazy" src="https://mezasalaman.github.io/BETA/Media/SATELOCK/stich.svg" alt="Gemini" class="h-6 w-6 brightness-0 invert" /></div>
                    <h3 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-bold">Stitch Gemini Integration</h3>
                    <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-[#64748b]">Utilizado como Content Creator dinámico para generar descripciones de servicios, metadatos SEO y comunicaciones transaccionales personalizadas en tiempo real.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col rounded-[40px] border border-electric/15 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#eaf0fb] to-[#dfe9fb] p-12 text-left transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-electric/40">
                    <div class="mb-9 flex h-[54px] w-[54px] items-center justify-center rounded-[14px] bg-[#2c6bff] shadow-[0_10px_20px_rgba(44,107,255,0.3)]"><img loading="lazy" src="https://mezasalaman.github.io/BETA/Media/SELLER%20CENTER/figma%20make.svg" alt="Figma" class="h-6 w-6 brightness-0 invert" /></div>
                    <h3 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-bold">Figma Make Automation</h3>
                    <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-[#64748b]">Automatización del design handoff y generación masiva de componentes atómicos, reduciendo el tiempo de producción visual en un 40%.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ================= DEEP RESEARCH INSIGHTS (BENTO) ================= -->
        <section class="mx-auto w-[90%] max-w-grid py-20">
            <div class="mb-14">
                <span class="mb-4 block text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-electric">USER EXPERIENCE PHASE</span>
                <h2 class="text-[32px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] sm:text-[48px]">Deep Research Insights</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
                <div class="rounded-[25px] border border-[#edf0f4] bg-[#eaf0fb] p-10">
                    <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4">
                        <img loading="lazy" src="https://mezasalaman.github.io/BETA/Media/SELLER%20CENTER/foto%20de%20perfil.svg" alt="Admin" class="h-[60px] w-[60px] rounded-full border-2 border-electric" />
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-[20px] font-semibold">Workshop Admin</h3>
                            <span class="text-[12px] text-[#94a3b8]">B2B Heavy User</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mb-6 text-[15px] italic leading-[1.6] text-[#64748b]">"Necesito visibilidad inmediata del estado de mis órdenes sin navegar por menús complejos."</p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <span class="rounded-md bg-electric/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-electric">EFFICIENCY</span>
                        <span class="rounded-md bg-electric/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-electric">DATA-DRIVEN</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-[25px] border border-[#edf0f4] bg-[#eaf0fb] p-10 lg:col-span-2">
                    <h3 class="text-[20px] font-semibold">Customer Journey Map: Friction to Flow</h3>
                    <div class="relative mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-4">
                        <div class="absolute left-0 right-0 top-5 z-[1] hidden h-0.5 bg-[#e7ebf1] sm:block"></div>
                        <div class="relative z-[2] text-center">
                            <div class="mx-auto mb-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#cdd9ee] font-bold">1</div>
                            <span class="mb-1.5 block text-[11px] font-bold text-[#94a3b8]">DISCOVERY</span>
                            <span class="text-[12px] text-[#64748b]">Chaos of scattered info</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="relative z-[2] text-center">
                            <div class="mx-auto mb-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-electric font-bold text-[#ffffff] shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(74,111,255,0.4)]">2</div>
                            <span class="mb-1.5 block text-[11px] font-bold text-[#94a3b8]">PUBLICATION</span>
                            <span class="text-[12px] text-[#64748b]">AI assisted content</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="relative z-[2] text-center">
                            <div class="mx-auto mb-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#cdd9ee] font-bold">3</div>
                            <span class="mb-1.5 block text-[11px] font-bold text-[#94a3b8]">MANAGEMENT</span>
                            <span class="text-[12px] text-[#64748b]">Centralized booking</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="relative z-[2] text-center">
                            <div class="mx-auto mb-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#cdd9ee] font-bold">4</div>
                            <span class="mb-1.5 block text-[11px] font-bold text-[#94a3b8]">CLOSURE</span>
                            <span class="text-[12px] text-[#64748b]">Automated sales track</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-[25px] border border-[#edf0f4] bg-[#eaf0fb] p-10">
                    <h3 class="mb-4 text-[20px] font-semibold">Card Sorting Results</h3>
                    <p class="mb-4 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#64748b]">Los usuarios agruparon Monitoreo, Alertas e Historial en un panel consolidado.</p>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[14px] font-semibold"><img loading="lazy" src="https://mezasalaman.github.io/BETA/Media/SELLER%20CENTER/check%20verde.svg" alt="check" class="h-[22px] w-auto" /><span>30% Efficiency Gain</span></div>
                    <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[14px] font-semibold"><img loading="lazy" src="https://mezasalaman.github.io/BETA/Media/SELLER%20CENTER/check%20verde.svg" alt="check" class="h-[22px] w-auto" /><span>Lower Cognitive Load</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-[25px] border border-[#edf0f4] bg-[#eaf0fb] p-10">
                    <h3 class="mb-4 text-[20px] font-semibold">Strategic Benchmarking</h3>
                    <p class="text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#64748b]">Identificamos un 'gap' crítico en la competencia: la falta de una herramienta de edición masiva de inventarios para talleres móviles.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-[25px] border border-[#edf0f4] bg-[#eaf0fb] p-10">
                    <h3 class="mb-4 text-[20px] font-semibold">Gap Analysis</h3>
                    <p class="text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#64748b]">Nuestra solución integra un sistema de geolocalización dinámica para conectar oferta cercana al comprador en milisegundos.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ================= DESIGN SYSTEM ================= -->
        <section class="mx-auto w-[90%] max-w-grid py-20">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr]">
                <div>
                    <span class="mb-5 block text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-electric">DESIGN LANGUAGE</span>
                    <h2 class="mb-8 text-[32px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] sm:text-[48px]">Atomic Design System</h2>
                    <p class="mb-12 text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-[#64748b]">Construido bajo una metodología atómica, garantizando que cada componente desde un simple botón (Atom) hasta dashboards complejos (Organism) mantenga una consistencia perfecta en cualquier dispositivo.</p>
                    <div class="flex gap-5">
                        <div class="flex-1 rounded-[15px] border border-[#e0e5ec] bg-ink p-6">
                            <span class="mb-4 block text-[12px] font-semibold">Typography</span>
                            <span class="text-[24px] font-bold text-[#0f172a]">Inter / 700</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex-1 rounded-[15px] border border-[#e0e5ec] bg-ink p-6">
                            <span class="mb-4 block text-[12px] font-semibold">Border Radius</span>
                            <span class="text-[24px] font-bold text-[#0f172a]">8px - 12px</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                        <div class="flex h-[180px] items-center justify-center rounded-[20px] bg-[#2c6bff] text-[14px] font-bold text-[#ffffff]">Primary</div>
                        <div class="flex h-[180px] items-center justify-center rounded-[20px] border border-[#e9edf2] bg-[#eaf0fb] text-[14px] font-bold">Surface</div>
                        <div class="flex h-[180px] items-center justify-center rounded-[20px] border border-[#e0e5ec] bg-[#eef1f5] text-[14px] font-bold">Elevated</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-center rounded-[20px] border border-dashed border-[#cfd6df] bg-[#eaf0fb] p-12">
                        <div class="flex gap-4">
                            <div class="h-[45px] w-[45px] rounded-lg border-2 border-[#2c6bff] bg-[#2c6bff]/10"></div>
                            <div class="h-[45px] w-[45px] rounded-lg border-2 border-[#2c6bff] bg-[#2c6bff]/10"></div>
                            <div class="h-[45px] w-[45px] rounded-lg border-2 border-[#2c6bff] bg-[#2c6bff]/10"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ================= INSIGHT V2 ================= -->
        <section class="mx-auto w-[90%] max-w-grid py-20">
            <div class="mb-14 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-8 border-b border-[#e9edf2] pb-10 lg:flex-row lg:items-end">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="mb-4 text-[30px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] sm:text-[38px]">Inteligencia Estratégica &amp; Insight de Usuario</h2>
                    <p class="text-[16px] text-[#64748b]">Metodologías de investigación aplicadas a la resolución de problemas en infraestructuras críticas.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-8">
                    <div class="text-center"><span class="block text-[28px] font-bold text-electric">12</span><span class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[1px] text-[#94a3b8]">ENTREVISTAS</span></div>
                    <div class="h-9 w-px bg-[#e7ebf1]"></div>
                    <div class="text-center"><span class="block text-[28px] font-bold text-electric">48h</span><span class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[1px] text-[#94a3b8]">SHADOWING</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
                <div class="flex flex-col rounded-[30px] border border-[#edf0f4] bg-[#f6f7f9] p-9">
                    <div class="mb-6 flex h-[45px] w-[45px] items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#f3f5f8]"><img loading="lazy" src="https://mezasalaman.github.io/BETA/Media/SELLER%20CENTER/PERsona.svg" alt="User" class="h-6 w-6" /></div>
                    <h3 class="mb-4 text-[22px] font-semibold">User Persona</h3>
                    <p class="mb-9 flex-1 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#64748b]">Administradores de taller que gestionan más de 50 órdenes simultáneamente.</p>
                    <div class="mb-3 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#f3f5f8]"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-electric" style="width:75%"></div></div>
                    <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-[#94a3b8]">FATIGA COGNITIVA</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col rounded-[30px] border border-[#edf0f4] bg-[#f6f7f9] p-9">
                    <div class="mb-6 flex h-[45px] w-[45px] items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#f3f5f8]"><img loading="lazy" src="https://mezasalaman.github.io/BETA/Media/SELLER%20CENTER/journy.svg" alt="Journey" class="h-6 w-6" /></div>
                    <h3 class="mb-4 text-[22px] font-semibold">Journey Map</h3>
                    <p class="mb-9 flex-1 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#64748b]">Identificación de puntos de fricción entre la publicación y el cierre de venta.</p>
                    <div class="flex gap-1.5">
                        <div class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-electric"></div>
                        <div class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-electric"></div>
                        <div class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-[#FF4B4B]"></div>
                        <div class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-[#f3f5f8]"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col rounded-[30px] border border-[#edf0f4] bg-[#f6f7f9] p-9">
                    <div class="mb-6 flex h-[45px] w-[45px] items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#f3f5f8]"><img loading="lazy" src="https://mezasalaman.github.io/BETA/Media/SELLER%20CENTER/card%20sorting.svg" alt="Sorting" class="h-6 w-6" /></div>
                    <h3 class="mb-4 text-[22px] font-semibold">Card Sorting</h3>
                    <p class="mb-9 flex-1 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#64748b]">Restructuración de la arquitectura de información para acceso rápido.</p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <span class="rounded-md bg-electric/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-electric">ALERTA</span>
                        <span class="rounded-md bg-electric/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-electric">MAPA</span>
